lz-disk-cleaner (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release v1.1.0
  * New features:
    - APT source manager (add, edit, enable/disable, delete sources)
    - Startup applications management
    - File shredder with secure deletion
    - Hardware monitoring (CPU, GPU, memory, disk usage)
    - Extended browser cache support (360, Loongson, QQ, Edge browsers)
  * Improvements:
    - Unified selection style across all modules
    - Refined settings dialog (removed unimplemented options)
    - Better dark theme support for warning dialogs
    - Fixed focus border display issues
  * Bug fixes:
    - Fixed warning visibility in dark theme
    - Fixed checkbox visibility when selected

 -- LZ Disk Cleaner Team <support@lz-disk-cleaner.org>  Mon, 16 Mar 2026 10:00:00 +0800

lz-disk-cleaner (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Features:
    - Disk usage analysis with visual pie charts
    - System cache and temporary file cleaning
    - APT package cache cleaning
    - Linglong application management and uninstall
    - System log cleanup (system logs, journal logs, crash reports)
    - File shredder with secure multi-pass deletion
    - System slimming and optimization
    - Real-time resource monitoring (CPU, Memory, Network)
    - Support for stubborn file deletion with privilege elevation
    - Dark/Light theme support
    - Chinese localization

 -- LZ Disk Cleaner Team <support@lz-disk-cleaner.org>  Sun, 09 Mar 2026 19:00:00 +0800
